# Selected two-expression C successor

Use successor/proposal.json (11FA3C23) after the immutable shared/proposal.json (C58D3183). The selected QuickJS C is successor/projected/vendor/quickjs/quickjs.c, SHA BC772BEE8794ADBD59385DA98F037310730704DFB9D251EA258862B1C887E454. QuickJS H and the other six shared outputs are unchanged.

